OL,3,GNEWSABeloved community-owned pub given
OL,4,Alegal protection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub which was saved by villagers -
OL,7,Fwith the help of a Hollywood star - has
OL,8,Fbeen given legal protection.
OL,10,FThe Swan in Enford reopened in April
OL,11,Fafter two new villagers helped the
OL,12,Fcommunity buy the Wiltshire pub's
OL,13,Ffreehold, while a roster of volunteers,
OL,14,Fincluding Rupert Everett, offered their
OL,15,Ftime to keep the venue going after the
OL,16,Flicensee left.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
