OL,3,GNEWSABeloved community-owned pub given
OL,4,Alegal protection
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pub, which is the only one in the
OL,7,Fvillage, has now been classed as an
OL,8,FAsset of Community Value, meaning the
OL,9,Fcommunity will have the right to bid
OL,10,Ffor the building if the owner ever
OL,11,Fchooses to sell.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for Enford Parish
OL,14,FCouncil said the protection would
OL,15,F"preserve the social fabric and
OL,16,Fwellbeing of our village for years to
OL,17,Fcome".
